PulseTEXT desk — START HERE
============================

Windows 10/11 (64-bit). No Node.js required.

  1. Run  PulseTEXT-Desk-Setup.exe
  2. Click through the wizard (Next → Install → Finish)
  3. In Ops → Settings, set your payment wallet

While streaming: leave the PulseTEXT Desk window open.

  Ops:     http://127.0.0.1:8787/ops
  Overlay: http://127.0.0.1:8787/overlay  (OBS browser source)

Never expose port 8787 to the internet.

Uninstall: Windows Settings → Apps → PulseTEXT Desk
